			"notes": "- Increased saving performance\n- Complete Challenges requirement now works with challenge-list names.\n- Added \"required-tags\" config entry to the following requirements: UseRareCandy, CatchPokemon, LevelUpTo, LevelUpOnce, EvolvePokemon, FossilRevived, DefeatBattler, TradeCompleted, and EXPGained. This allows you to more specifically control which pokemon will be targetted. This makes the is_legendary and is_ultrabeast config entries obsolete, but they will be retained for backwards compatibility.\n- DefeatBattler no longer considers captures to be a defeat\n- IncreaseLevelOnce increases progress for every level if their level up increases by more than one level at a time.\n\nExample usage of \"required-tags\":\n```yaml\nlevel_up_once: # Win a battle with these conditions\n  pokename: any\n  amount: 5\n  required-tags: mythical/legendary/ultra_beast\n```\nThe tags can be found here: https://gitlab.com/cable-mc/cobblemon/-/blob/main/common/src/main/kotlin/com/cobblemon/mod/common/api/pokemon/labels/CobblemonPokemonLabels.kt"
		},
