			"notes": "Added a huge list of minor changes to improve quality. Here are a few changes:\n\n- Fixed bug with progression saving\n- Increased accuracy of play time challenges\n- Challenges now keep their sorting order in the config for the GUIs\n- A lot more, I've been making changes to make it better as a whole, and basically every file had changes so I've forgotten. Oops!\n- Added API to add custom challenge types. Create a Requirement class and then register like this:\n ```\nRegisterRequirementsEvent.EVENT.register {\n    RequirementLoader.register(CompleteMartQuestRequirement::class.java)\n}\n  ```"
